but it was all I needed to understand.

328
00:31:50,460 --> 00:31:53,360
日が沈み出した空と君の姿
The sinking sun and your figure

329
00:31:53,520 --> 00:31:58,020
フェンス越しに重なっていた
were overlapping beyond the fence.

330
00:31:59,100 --> 00:32:01,940
初めて会った日から
Ever since the first day we met,

331
00:32:01,940 --> 00:32:05,220
僕の心の全てを奪った
you stole all of my heart.

332
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:08,620
どこか儚い空気を纏う君は
Wrapped in some sort of fragile air,

333
00:32:08,620 --> 00:32:11,020
寂しい目をしていたんだ
you had a lonely gaze.

334
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:17,440
いつだってチックタックと鳴る世界で何度だってさ
Again and again in the world always ringing with "tick-tocks",

335
00:32:17,700 --> 00:32:23,800
触れる心無い言葉うるさい声に涙が零れそうでも
Even if the tears seem about to spill over touching thoughtless words and irritating voices,

336
00:32:24,080 --> 00:32:28,060
ありきたりな喜びきっと二人なら見つけられる
As long as we're together, I'm sure we can find an ordinary happiness.

337
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:33,300
騒がしい日々に笑えない君に思い付く限り眩しい明日を
In the troubling days, for the never-smiling you, I give my utmost wishes for a dazzling tomorrow.

338
00:32:33,300 --> 00:32:39,060
明けない夜に落ちていく前に僕の手を掴んでほんで
Before we fall in the never-ending night, come and take my hand.

339
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:46,240
忘れてしまいたくて閉じ込めた日々も
Even the days where you shut yourself away, wanting to forget,

340
00:32:46,240 --> 00:32:49,940
抱きしめた温もりで溶かすから
I'll melt with the warmth of my embrace,

341
00:32:50,100 --> 00:32:56,220
怖くないよいつか日が昇るまで二人でいよう
So don't be afraid. Until the sun rises again someday, let's be together.

342
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:13,680
君にしか見えない
I hate it when you stare at

343
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:16,940
何かを見つめる君が嫌いだ
the things only you can see.

344
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:22,140
見惚れているかのような恋するようなそんな顔が嫌いだ
Like you're captivated by it, or you're in love—I hate that expression.

345
00:33:22,500 --> 00:33:26,840
信じてたいけど信じられないことそんなのどうしたってきっと
The things I want to believe but I can't... No matter what I do,

346
00:33:26,840 --> 00:33:30,380
これからだっていくつもあって
they'll pop up again and again from now on.

347
00:33:30,560 --> 00:33:33,960
そのたんび怒って泣いていくの
